{
  "$schema": "https://agent-plugins.org/schemas/1.0.0/plugin.schema.json",
  "name": "zuihan-kanshu",
  "version": "@VERSION@",
  "description": "Answer mathematical questions, conduct sustained research, and plan, write, or revise mathematical documents with quality as the default priority, plus Chinese terminology, style, and Markdown, TeX, and PDF support.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Adjoint Functor"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu",
  "repository": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": ["mathematics", "research", "writing", "chinese", "latex", "agent-skills"],
  "extensions": {
    "com.openai": {
      "interface": {
        "displayName": "瑞般观珠",
        "shortDescription": "Math Q&A, research & writing",
        "longDescription": "Use ChatGPT Work for mathematical questions, sustained research, and mathematical writing in the cloud. Work through questions with derivations, proofs, and relevant literature; explore a research goal and keep records for continuing it; or plan, draft, review, and revise a mathematical document with quality as the default priority.\n\nNew writing batches begin with a saved plan and discussion by default. Writing guidance applies from the start; whole-manuscript structure and consistency, suitable introductions, Chinese expression, and prose receive dedicated review as appropriate. Intermediate rounds save the manuscript and control file, with PDF preparation at the final delivery stage unless requested earlier.\n\nThe bundled mathematical research mini-agents provide task-based collaboration when the host supports delegation. Model choices, delegation, retrieval, compilation, and storage follow the current user's instructions and the host's available tools. Research records, writing plans, and manuscripts are saved in the cloud Library by default when available. Specify a folder or let the skill create one by topic; existing projects keep their folder. Ordinary questions and usage help stay in the conversation by default. Other environments use the available destination and report where files were actually saved.\n\nThe name comes from the Japanese mathematical term 随伴関手 (ずいはんかんしゅ, adjoint functor), echoed in the characters 瑞般観珠 and written 瑞般观珠 in Chinese.",
        "developerName": "Adjoint Functor",
        "category": "Education & Research",
        "websiteURL": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu",
        "supportURL": "https://github.com/adjoint-functor/zuihan-kanshu/issues",
        "capabilities": ["数学问答", "数学研究", "数学写作"],
        "defaultPrompt": [
          "使用瑞般观珠解答以下数学问题，并按需要给出推导、证明或文献依据。问题：……。",
          "使用瑞般观珠，围绕以下目标开展数学研究，将研究记录与阶段成果保存在云端。研究目标：……。",
          "使用瑞般观珠，根据以下要求制定数学文稿的写作计划，并保存在云端。写作要求：……。"
        ],
        "composerIcon": "./assets/icon-256.png",
        "composerIconDark": "./assets/icon-dark-256.png",
        "logo": "./assets/icon-1024.png",
        "logoDark": "./assets/icon-dark-1024.png",
        "brandColor": "#087F79",
        "brandColorDark": "#64D5C7"
      },
      "review": {
        "commerce": false,
        "commerce_description": "The plugin itself is offered without a fee and has no purchases or payment processing. Host platforms and third-party services set their own access requirements and pricing."
      },
      "publication": {
        "countries": [],
        "release_notes": "v8.5.0: This update puts quality first in the default writing workflow and is expected to substantially improve the resulting manuscripts. It adds planning around the manuscript's main line, whole-manuscript structure and consistency review by the actual main agent, suitable introduction writing, and final language reviews. Intermediate rounds save sources without requiring PDF builds. Work guidance, research entry points, and writing references are updated.",
        "translations": {
          "zh-CN": {
            "subtitle": "数学问答、研究与写作",
            "description": "请在 ChatGPT Work 中使用瑞般观珠，在云端开展数学问题解答、持续研究与数学写作。针对具体问题提供解答、推导与必要文献依据；围绕研究目标梳理文献、探索思路与证明，保存进展并接续已有工作。数学写作支持规划、撰写与修订，默认以质量为先。\n\n新写作批次默认先保存计划并讨论，从开始使用文风和适用的中文指导；全稿结构与一致性、适用的论文式导语和最终语言审读各按流程完成。中间轮保存正文和控制，最终交付时按目标制作 PDF，也可明确要求阶段 PDF。\n\n内置数学研究迷你智能体、中文术语与翻译、文风及 Markdown、TeX、PDF 支持。模型、委派、检索、编译和保存遵循用户指示及宿主实际能力。研究记录、写作计划与文稿默认保存在可用的云端库中，可指定目录；未指定时按主题建立，接续沿用原目录。普通问答和使用帮助默认在对话内完成。其他环境按实际可用位置保存并说明。\n\n名称取意于数学术语「随伴関手」（ずいはんかんしゅ，Adjoint Functor），以其日语读音谐作「瑞般観珠」，中文写作「瑞般观珠」。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
